The window bundles SolidJS (MIT, https://www.solidjs.com) and the IBM Plex fonts
(SIL Open Font Licence 1.1).

The built-in materials data (data/*.json) is our own compilation of public values. Every value
names its source in data/sources.json; those sources keep their own terms. No proprietary
materials database was used.
